{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10609013","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10609013","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1060901301:1":{"text":"这次试航的<style=\"highlight\">欢宴木翼机</style>是达米安的新发明，在保持稳定性的同时提升了承重能力，可以一边飞行一边洒落彩带和烟花，最适合用来庆祝了！","source_cn":"这次试航的<style=highlight>欢宴木翼机...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A54F4BB6F98930","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1060901302:1":{"text":"除此之外，木翼机也会搭载一些小礼物，在飞行的过程洒满全场，给每位客人都带去一份小小的惊喜！","source_cn":"除此之外，木翼机也会搭载一些小礼物，在飞行的过程洒满全...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5E7BC6B343CF1FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1060901303:1":{"text":"不过……众所周知，达米安这孩子的发明或多或少总有一些缺陷，这次也不例外。欢宴木翼机造价高昂，但只能飞行一次，没办法重复利用。","source_cn":"不过……众所周知，达米安这孩子的发明或多或少总有一些缺...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A573B677D79B787","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1060901304:1":{"text":"所以，每一架木翼机试航时，我们都会收取一些费用，希望各位客人不要介意。","source_cn":"所以，每一架木翼机试航时，我们都会收取一些费用，希望各...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A708FAB10845543","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1060901305:1":{"text":"如果对欢宴木翼机感兴趣，或者想邀请大家观看木翼机飞行的话，可以随时来找我哦！","source_cn":"如果对欢宴木翼机感兴趣，或者想邀请大家观看木翼机飞行的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA2D3CA624893929","variant_status":